# Tracker #70: automatic battery calibration's developer rows
# (apps/ipodui/batcal.c, docs/batcal-brief.md section 5). A fresh disk shows
# "Built-in table" and "Run: waiting for a full charge". Two stored fits and
# a cleanly stopped 3 h run (fixtures/batcal/, made by the same CRC as the
# firmware) are copied in; after a reboot the rows read "Calibrated: 2 runs,
# last 2026-10-11" and "Run: 3 h logged" (the run carries on: boot decision
# KEEP, its file rewritten open at boot). "Reset battery calibration" asks
# for a second press ("Select again within 5 s"); the second removes
# both files and the rows go back to the built-in table. No file name on
# screen.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-batcal-dev.script
# timeout: 90
# log: batcal boot fits=0 run n=0
# log: batcal boot fits=2 run n=180
# log: batcal reset
# nolog: batcal table file ignored
# nolog: batcal run dropped
# golden-region: dev_builtin 0 8 320 240
# golden-region: dev_calibrated 0 8 320 240
# golden-region: dev_confirm 0 8 320 240
# golden-region: dev_reset 0 8 320 240
#   (the stock status bar's clock, rows 0-7, reads the host RTC: skipped,
#   as in ipodui-p8a-devmode)

wait 5000           # boot to the main menu (no calibration files)
wheel +3            # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1500
key SELECT          # About
wait 1500
chord SELECT+LEFT 3200
wait 1000
wheel +4            # Reset battery calibration (5th row: Status, Power log, every, the table)
wait 600
shot dev_builtin
key LEFT            # leave developer mode (About again)
wait 1500
copy fixtures/batcal/batcal.dat /.rockbox/batcal.dat
copy fixtures/batcal/batcal.run /.rockbox/batcal.run
reboot
wait 5000
wheel +3            # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1500
key SELECT          # About
wait 1500
chord SELECT+LEFT 3200
wait 1000
wheel +4            # Reset battery calibration
wait 600
shot dev_calibrated
key SELECT          # first press: the row asks for a second
wait 1000
shot dev_confirm
key SELECT          # second press, within 5 s: reset
wait 1000
shot dev_reset
key LEFT
wait 1000
quit
